<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE topic PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Topic//EN" "topic.dtd">
<topic id="git-addon-git-staging-view-interface">
  <title>Git Staging View Interface</title>
  <shortdesc>The <uicontrol>Git Staging</uicontrol> view is the main interface for Git operations in
      <ph keyref="product"/>. It includes toolbar actions, file areas, and a commit message
    area.</shortdesc>
  <prolog>
    <metadata>
      <keywords>
        <indexterm>Git Client add-on<indexterm>Git Staging view</indexterm></indexterm>
      </keywords>
    </metadata>
  </prolog>
  <body>
      <p id="p_pbt_wn5_nsb">To open the <uicontrol>Git Staging</uicontrol> view, select it from
        the <menucascade>
          <uicontrol>Window</uicontrol>
          <uicontrol>Show View</uicontrol>
        </menucascade> menu, or select <uicontrol>Git Client</uicontrol> from the
          <uicontrol>Tools</uicontrol> menu. The <uicontrol>Git Staging</uicontrol> view is the main
        interface for most Git commands and related features.</p>
      <p id="p_ykk_p45_nsb">
        <fig id="fig_tlr_p45_nsb">
          <title>Git Staging View</title>
          <image href="../img/git-staging-view.png"
          />
        </fig>
      </p>
      <p id="p_ulr_t45_nsb">The <uicontrol>Git Staging</uicontrol> view includes the following
        actions and areas. Most actions are also available in the <uicontrol>Git</uicontrol> menu.</p>
      <p id="p_fpq_v45_nsb">
        <dl id="dl_kl5_v45_nsb">
          <dlentry id="dlentry_ll5_v45_nsb">
            <dt><uicontrol><image href="../img/PreviousReference16.png"/>Push</uicontrol></dt>
            <dd>Pushes your local repository changes to the remote repository. The arrow icon has a
              small plus sign in the bottom-right corner when there are changes that have not yet
              been pushed to the repository.</dd>
          </dlentry>
          <dlentry id="dlentry_ik5_1p5_nsb">
            <dt><uicontrol><image href="../img/NextReference16.png"/>Pull</uicontrol></dt>
            <dd>Pulls the changes from the remote repository into your local repository.</dd>
          </dlentry>
          <dlentry id="dlentry_lyq_dp5_nsb">
            <dt><uicontrol><image href="../img/Stash18.png"/>Stash</uicontrol> drop-down menu</dt>
            <dd>Includes the following submenu items:<p id="p_ets_3p5_nsb">
                <dl id="dl_vqv_3p5_nsb">
                  <dlentry id="dlentry_wqv_3p5_nsb">
                    <dt><uicontrol>Stash changes</uicontrol></dt>
                    <dd>Creates a new stash from the changed files in the working copy.</dd>
                  </dlentry>
                  <dlentry id="dlentry_jqd_mp5_nsb">
                    <dt><uicontrol>List stashes</uicontrol></dt>
                    <dd>Opens a dialog box that lists the existing stashes and lets you apply or
                      remove a stash.</dd>
                  </dlentry>
                </dl>
              </p></dd>
          </dlentry>
          <dlentry id="dlentry_mbg_rp5_nsb">
            <dt><uicontrol><image href="../img/History18.png"/>Show current repository
                history</uicontrol></dt>
            <dd>Opens the <xref href="git-addon-showing-the-repository-history.dita#git-addon-showing-the-repository-history"><uicontrol>Git
                  History</uicontrol> view</xref> at the bottom of the application.</dd>
          </dlentry>
        </dl>
        <dl id="dl_mn2_j55_nsb">
          <dlentry id="dlentry_fv4_mq5_nsb">
            <dt><uicontrol><image href="../img/Branch18.png"/>Show Git Branch Manager
                view</uicontrol></dt>
            <dd>Opens the <xref href="git-addon-git-branch-manager.dita#git-addon-git-branch-manager"><uicontrol>Git Branch
                  Manager</uicontrol> view</xref> on the right side of the application.</dd>
          </dlentry>
          <dlentry id="dlentry_y5k_sq5_nsb">
            <dt><uicontrol><image href="../img/Ellipsis18.png"/>Ellipsis (three vertical
                dots)</uicontrol> menu</dt>
            <dd>Includes the following submenu items:<p id="p_ohb_2r5_nsb">
                <dl id="dl_mmg_2r5_nsb">
                  <dlentry id="dlentry_nmg_2r5_nsb">
                    <dt><uicontrol><image href="../img/Add16.png"/>Clone repository</uicontrol></dt>
                    <dd>Clones a repository into a new directory.</dd>
                  </dlentry>
                  <dlentry>
                    <dt><uicontrol>Create repository in project</uicontrol></dt>
                    <dd>Creates a repository in the project folder. Enabled when a Git repository
                      does not already exist there.</dd>
                  </dlentry>
                  <dlentry>
                    <dt><uicontrol>Show working copy in</uicontrol></dt>
                    <dd>Opens a submenu with the following actions: <p>
                        <dl>
                          <dlentry>
                            <dt><uicontrol>Explorer</uicontrol> (<uicontrol>Finder</uicontrol> on
                              macOS)</dt>
                            <dd>Opens the working copy folder in the system file manager.</dd>
                          </dlentry>
                          <dlentry>
                            <dt><uicontrol>Terminal</uicontrol></dt>
                            <dd>Opens the working copy folder in a terminal window. </dd>
                          </dlentry>
                        </dl>
                      </p></dd>
                  </dlentry>
                </dl>
                <dl id="dl_nn2_j55_nsb">
                  <dlentry id="dlentry_pwc_fr5_nsb">
                    <dt><uicontrol><image href="../img/PreviousReference16.png"
                      />Push</uicontrol></dt>
                    <dd>Pushes your local repository changes to the remote repository.</dd>
                  </dlentry>
                  <dlentry id="dlentry_ofg_fr5_nsb">
                    <dt><uicontrol>Pull (merge)</uicontrol></dt>
                    <dd>Pulls the latest changes from the remote repository and combines them with
                      your local unpublished changes by creating one new merge commit.</dd>
                  </dlentry>
                  <dlentry id="dlentry_lzh_fr5_nsb">
                    <dt><uicontrol>Pull (rebase)</uicontrol></dt>
                    <dd>Pulls the latest changes from the remote repository, rewrites their commits,
                      and reapplies them on top of your local unpublished changes.</dd>
                  </dlentry>
                  <dlentry>
                    <dt><uicontrol>Pull...</uicontrol></dt>
                    <dd>Allows you to pull changes from a remote branch other than the one being
                      tracked.</dd>
                  </dlentry>
                  <dlentry id="dlentry_gfj_fr5_nsb">
                    <dt><uicontrol><image href="../img/Branch18.png"/>Show branches</uicontrol></dt>
                    <dd>Opens the <xref href="git-addon-git-branch-manager.dita#git-addon-git-branch-manager"><uicontrol>Git Branch
                          Manager</uicontrol> view</xref> on the right side of the application.</dd>
                  </dlentry>
                  <dlentry id="dlentry_pfk_fr5_nsb">
                    <dt><uicontrol><image href="../img/Tags18.png"/>Show tags</uicontrol></dt>
                    <dd>Opens a dialog box that lists all tags. You can delete tags, checkout a
                      specific tag, or push a tag that is only present in the local branch to the
                      remote repository.</dd>
                  </dlentry>
                  <dlentry id="dlentry_ihl_fr5_nsb">
                    <dt><uicontrol><image href="../img/History18.png"/>Show history</uicontrol></dt>
                    <dd>Opens the <xref href="git-addon-showing-the-repository-history.dita#git-addon-showing-the-repository-history"><uicontrol>Git
                          History</uicontrol> view</xref> at the bottom of the application.</dd>
                  </dlentry>
                  <dlentry id="dlentry_m3m_fr5_nsb">
                    <dt><uicontrol><image href="../img/Submodules18.png"/>Submodule</uicontrol></dt>
                    <dd>Opens a combo box where you can select the desired submodule to open and
                      work with.</dd>
                  </dlentry>
                  <dlentry id="dlentry_amn_fr5_nsb">
                    <dt><uicontrol>Stash changes</uicontrol></dt>
                    <dd>Creates a new stash from the changed files in the working copy.</dd>
                  </dlentry>
                  <dlentry id="dlentry_fn4_fr5_nsb">
                    <dt><uicontrol>List stashes</uicontrol></dt>
                    <dd>Opens a dialog box that lists the existing stashes and lets you apply or
                      remove a stash.</dd>
                  </dlentry>
                  <dlentry id="dlentry_sqp_fr5_nsb">
                    <dt><uicontrol><image href="../img/Remote18.png"/>Manage remote
                        repositories</uicontrol></dt>
                    <dd>Opens a dialog box where you can add, edit, or delete existing remote
                      repositories.</dd>
                  </dlentry>
                  <dlentry id="dlentry_etq_fr5_nsb">
                    <dt><uicontrol>Track remote branch</uicontrol></dt>
                    <dd>Opens a dialog box where you can select a remote branch that the local
                      branch will track for executing fetch, push, or pull commands.</dd>
                  </dlentry>
                  <dlentry id="dlentry_prr_fr5_nsb">
                    <dt><uicontrol>Edit repository "config" file</uicontrol></dt>
                    <dd>Opens the repository configuration file in the main editor.</dd>
                  </dlentry>
                  <dlentry id="dlentry_eps_fr5_nsb">
                    <dt><uicontrol>Preferences</uicontrol></dt>
                    <dd>Opens the <uicontrol>Git Client</uicontrol> preferences page, where you can
                      configure options for the add-on.</dd>
                  </dlentry>
                  <dlentry id="dlentry_qnt_fr5_nsb">
                    <dt><uicontrol>Reset all credentials</uicontrol></dt>
                    <dd>Removes stored credentials so that the Git Client prompts you for new ones
                      when needed.</dd>
                  </dlentry>
                </dl>
              </p></dd>
          </dlentry>
          <dlentry id="dlentry_rcg_nr5_nsb">
            <dt><uicontrol>Unstaged files</uicontrol> area</dt>
            <dd>Any changed, unstaged files are listed in this box.</dd>
          </dlentry>
          <dlentry>
            <dt><uicontrol>Stage/Unstage actions and view modes</uicontrol></dt>
            <dd>
              <p>
                <dl id="dl_gng_s3j_43c">
                  <dlentry id="dlentry_jyd_tr5_nsb">
                    <dt><uicontrol><image href="../img/StageSelected18.png" id="image_vbv_n3j_43c"
                          placement="inline"/>Stage selected</uicontrol></dt>
                    <dd>Moves the selected unstaged, changed files to the <uicontrol>Staged
                        files</uicontrol> area.</dd>
                  </dlentry>
                  <dlentry id="dlentry_rvy_tr5_nsb">
                    <dt><uicontrol><image href="../img/StageAll18.png" id="image_wbv_n3j_43c"
                          placement="inline"/>Stage all</uicontrol></dt>
                    <dd>Moves all unstaged, changed files to the <uicontrol>Staged files</uicontrol>
                      area.</dd>
                  </dlentry>
                  <dlentry id="dlentry_wmw_vr5_nsb">
                    <dt><uicontrol><image href="../img/UnstageSelected18.png" id="image_brz_43j_43c"
                          placement="inline"/>Unstage selected</uicontrol></dt>
                    <dd>Moves the selected staged files to the <uicontrol>Unstaged files</uicontrol>
                      area.</dd>
                  </dlentry>
                  <dlentry id="dlentry_xmw_vr5_nsb">
                    <dt><uicontrol><image href="../img/UnstageAll18.png" id="image_crz_43j_43c"
                          placement="inline"/>Unstage all</uicontrol></dt>
                    <dd>Moves all staged files to the <uicontrol>Unstaged files</uicontrol>
                      area.</dd>
                  </dlentry>
                  <dlentry id="dlentry_eh5_5r5_nsb">
                    <dt><uicontrol><image href="../img/Tree18.png" id="image_xbv_n3j_43c"
                          placement="inline"/>Switch to tree view</uicontrol> / <uicontrol><image
                          href="../img/Flat18.png" placement="inline" id="image_p2p_hjj_43c"/>Switch
                        to list view</uicontrol></dt>
                    <dd>Switches between a tree view and a flat list view.</dd>
                  </dlentry>
                </dl>
              </p>
            </dd>
          </dlentry>
          <dlentry id="dlentry_tmw_vr5_nsb">
            <dt><uicontrol>Staged files</uicontrol> area</dt>
            <dd>Lists all files that are ready to be committed.</dd>
          </dlentry>
          <dlentry id="dlentry_lyj_yr5_nsb">
            <dt><uicontrol>Commit message</uicontrol> area</dt>
            <dd>Use this area to write the commit message. The following actions are available in
              the top-right corner of the box:<p id="p_myj_yr5_nsb">
                <dl id="dl_nyj_yr5_nsb">
                  <dlentry id="dlentry_tr4_jbs_fdc">
                    <dt><uicontrol><image href="../img/AI-Git16.png"/>Generate commit message using
                        AI</uicontrol></dt>
                    <dd>Uses <xref
                        href="https://www.oxygenxml.com/doc/ug-positron-desktop/ai/ai_positron.html"
                        scope="external" format="html"><uicontrol>AI
                          Positron</uicontrol></xref> to generate a commit message.</dd>
                  </dlentry>
                  <dlentry id="dlentry_oyj_yr5_nsb">
                    <dt><uicontrol><image href="../img/PreviousCommit18.png"/>Choose a previously
                        used comment</uicontrol></dt>
                    <dd>Lets you reuse a previous commit message.</dd>
                  </dlentry>
                  <dlentry id="dlentry_pyj_yr5_nsb">
                    <dt><uicontrol><image href="../img/AutoPush18.png"/>Automatically push changes
                        to remote branch</uicontrol></dt>
                    <dd>Pushes the committed changes to the remote repository after a commit is
                      performed.</dd>
                  </dlentry>
                  <dlentry id="dlentry_qyj_yr5_nsb">
                    <dt><uicontrol><image href="../img/Ammend18.png"/>Amend last
                      commit</uicontrol></dt>
                    <dd>Lets you edit the selected commit. You can combine staged changes with the
                      previous commit instead of creating a new commit. You can also edit the
                      previous commit message without changing its snapshot. Do not use this action
                      on public commits, which are commits that were pushed to the remote
                      repository.</dd>
                  </dlentry>
                </dl>
              </p></dd>
          </dlentry>
        </dl>
      </p>
  </body>
</topic>